  "content": "<div class=\"p-8 font-sans max-w-lg mx-auto bg-black text-white rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n  <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-64 h-64 bg-yellow-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n  \n  <div class=\"text-text-center relative z-10 space-y-6 text-center\">\n    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-mono tracking-[0.25em] text-yellow-500 uppercase\">The Grand Celebration</p>\n    <div class=\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tight font-serif italic text-white z-10\">O Grande Baile</div>\n    \n    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 max-w-sm mx-auto leading-relaxed\">\n      A conquista está cumprida! <strong class=\"text-white\">{{nome_graduado}}</strong> orgulhosamente convida você para o grandioso baile de formatura de <strong class=\"text-yellow-500\">{{nome_curso}}</strong>!\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"my-6 border-y border-zinc-800 py-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-center\">\n      <div class=\"bg-zinc-950 p-3 rounded-lg border border-zinc-800\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">A Data</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-sm text-yellow-400 font-sans\">{{data_baile}}</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-zinc-950 p-3 rounded-lg border border-zinc-800\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Recepção</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-sm text-yellow-400 font-sans\">{{horario_baile}} H</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-[#0c0c0c] p-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 text-center\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Onde vamos celebrar</span>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-white font-medium\">{{espaco_evento}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 font-mono tracking-wide\">\n      Dress Code Obrigatório: <strong class=\"text-yellow-500 font-sans\">{{detalhes_dress_code}}</strong>\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n      <span class=\"inline-block bg-yellow-500 text-black font-extrabold text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest py-2.5 px-6 rounded-full transition shadow-lg\">\n        Venha brindar conosco! 🥂\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
